<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>okizari ni shita omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

16
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>of the feelings abandoned within the flows of time</b></font></font></font>

17
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>wasureta koto sura wasurete ita</b></font></font></font>

18
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>have also been lost</b></font></font></font>

19
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kuzure kaketa toki kodoku wo shitte</b></font></font></font>

20
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>when sinking down we learned loneliness</b></font></font></font>

21
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>deaeta bokura hitori ja nai</b></font></font></font>

22
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>but now we've met each other we are no longer alone</b></font></font></font>

23
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>sarake dase kanjou wo banjou no omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

24
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>unveil your feelings those high emotions</b></font></font></font>

25
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>namidame ga unmei wo kaete yuku</b></font></font></font>

26
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>those tears will change your fate</b></font></font></font>

27
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>yami ni uchi narase kodou wo</b></font></font></font>

28
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>pound your heartbeat against the darkness</b></font></font></font>

29
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kitto aeru yo onaji itami no hata no moto de</b></font></font></font>

30
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>we're sure to meet under the same flag of pain</b></font></font></font>

31
00:01:32,690 --> 00:01:38,620
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Reunite</font>

32
00:01:32,690 --> 00:01:38,620
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Time Left</font>

33
00:01:57,800 --> 00:01:59,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's going to happen?!</font>

34
00:02:19,990 --> 00:02:21,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the deal?!</font>

35
00:02:21,660 --> 00:02:23,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru's mom is being
pressed back!</font>

36
00:02:27,460 --> 00:02:29,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My star training
is done my own way.</font>

37
00:02:30,120 --> 00:02:31,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It shouldn't be a match</font>

38
00:02:31,380 --> 00:02:35,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for one who has completed
proper star training like you.</font>

39
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:37,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But what's with that sorry state...?</font>

40
00:02:38,550 --> 00:02:42,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't feel even a smidgeon
of the power from before.</font>

41
00:02:44,100 --> 00:02:47,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure enough, you've also got
side-effects from the star training...</font>

42
00:02:59,570 --> 00:03:01,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if this life should end...</font>

43
00:03:01,700 --> 00:03:03,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll never forgive you!</font>

44
00:03:06,490 --> 00:03:07,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord Akahoshi!</font>

45
00:03:07,910 --> 00:03:08,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

46
00:03:27,810 --> 00:03:29,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You be a good boy!</font>

47
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:32,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a simple mission.
We'll be able to come back right away.</font>

48
00:03:32,810 --> 00:03:34,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right! Have a safe journey.</font>

49
00:03:40,070 --> 00:03:41,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mother!</font>

50
00:03:42,700 --> 00:03:44,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mother!</font>

51
00:03:46,080 --> 00:03:47,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mother!</font>

52
00:03:52,500 --> 00:03:53,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru...!</font>

53
00:03:57,550 --> 00:04:01,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mother!</font>

54
00:04:02,550 --> 00:04:03,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru!</font>

55
00:04:11,770 --> 00:04:12,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, no!</font>

56
00:04:26,240 --> 00:04:28,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord Akahoshi.
Why would you do such a thing?</font>

57
00:04:28,990 --> 00:04:30,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it true then...?</font>

58
00:04:40,960 --> 00:04:42,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give it back...</font>

59
00:04:55,770 --> 00:04:56,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hold it!</font>

60
00:04:57,560 --> 00:04:58,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Farewell.</font>

61
00:04:59,110 --> 00:05:00,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

62
00:05:05,570 --> 00:05:06,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then it was Lord Akahoshi</font>

63
00:05:06,820 --> 00:05:09,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who knocked everyone out
and took Sumaru away?</font>

64
00:05:09,910 --> 00:05:11,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A sensei who does something
like that</font>

65
00:05:12,080 --> 00:05:14,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to students who believe in him
is unforgivable!</font>

66
00:05:14,960 --> 00:05:17,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why in the world...?
Why would you do such a thing?</font>

67
00:05:17,540 --> 00:05:19,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's all for the sake of the village...</font>

68
00:05:19,290 --> 00:05:21,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's for the sake of taking back
the star she stole!</font>

69
00:05:22,130 --> 00:05:23,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if that were the case,</font>

70
00:05:23,260 --> 00:05:25,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that doesn't make for a reason
to cause Sumaru pain!</font>

71
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:29,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That person is Sumaru's mom!</font>

72
00:05:30,470 --> 00:05:33,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My... mother...</font>

73
00:05:33,930 --> 00:05:35,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Exactly!</font>

74
00:05:35,390 --> 00:05:39,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, even if she is your mother,
she's now your enemy!</font>

75
00:05:40,940 --> 00:05:43,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The person before you
is the woman who stole the star</font>

76
00:05:43,690 --> 00:05:46,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and attempted to bring about
the doom to our village!</font>

77
00:05:46,990 --> 00:05:48,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's wrong!</font>

78
00:05:48,450 --> 00:05:50,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru's mom just hid the star</font>

79
00:05:51,030 --> 00:05:54,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in order to save everyone from
the pain of the training!</font>

80
00:05:54,500 --> 00:05:57,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Foolishness! Being able to die
for the sake of the village</font>

81
00:05:57,290 --> 00:05:58,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is a Shinobi's long-cherished dream!</font>

82
00:05:58,960 --> 00:06:00,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't that right, Sumaru?!</font>

83
00:06:00,540 --> 00:06:03,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're going to become the Hoshikage
and put to shame</font>

84
00:06:03,920 --> 00:06:06,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Five Great Hidden Villages
that treated us with contempt, right?</font>

85
00:06:06,920 --> 00:06:10,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes... I want to become the Hoshikage
and put them to shame...</font>

86
00:06:11,260 --> 00:06:15,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Show your foolish mother
your determination!</font>

87
00:06:17,520 --> 00:06:19,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes... I can die if it's for
the sake of the village.</font>

88
00:06:19,900 --> 00:06:20,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru!</font>

89
00:06:20,810 --> 00:06:22,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't do anything stupid, Sumaru!</font>

90
00:06:25,360 --> 00:06:27,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His Chakra is in sync with Akahoshi's.</font>

91
00:06:28,030 --> 00:06:29,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru is being controlled!</font>

92
00:06:29,700 --> 00:06:30,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

93
00:06:32,660 --> 00:06:37,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Exactly... I have Sumaru's life
in the palm of my hand.</font>

94
00:06:38,710 --> 00:06:40,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lady Natsuhi.</font>

95
00:06:40,540 --> 00:06:42,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I shall give you the ultimate choice!</font>

96
00:06:43,590 --> 00:06:45,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Will you take the star?</font>

97
00:06:45,130 --> 00:06:48,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Or... your son's life?</font>

98
00:06:50,930 --> 00:06:51,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

99
00:06:54,100 --> 00:06:56,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter, Lady Natsuhi?</font>

100
00:06:56,680 --> 00:06:59,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Have you realized
your own foolishness?</font>

101
00:07:02,980 --> 00:07:04,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lady...</font>

102
00:07:04,360 --> 00:07:06,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You win, Akahoshi.</font>

103
00:07:55,030 --> 00:07:56,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru!</font>

104
00:08:00,370 --> 00:08:01,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You did it!</font>

105
00:08:01,910 --> 00:08:04,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Excellent. How did you get it?</font>

106
00:08:04,790 --> 00:08:09,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Simple, Lady Natsuhi returned it
with good grace.</font>

107
00:08:11,340 --> 00:08:12,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lady!</font>

108
00:08:27,610 --> 00:08:28,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's dirty!</font>

109
00:08:30,190 --> 00:08:32,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru!</font>

110
00:08:39,330 --> 00:08:40,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru...</font>

111
00:08:41,160 --> 00:08:43,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that person... really...?</font>

112
00:08:44,670 --> 00:08:46,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you doing?!</font>

113
00:08:46,880 --> 00:08:48,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Multiple Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

114
00:08:50,710 --> 00:08:53,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— You...! I won't forgive you!
— You...! I won't forgive you!</font>

115
00:08:54,590 --> 00:08:59,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hidden Leaf Shinobi,
I'm your employer.</font>

116
00:08:59,640 --> 00:09:01,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— That doesn't make any difference!
— That doesn't make any difference!</font>

117
00:09:02,100 --> 00:09:03,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait, Naruto!</font>

118
00:09:03,890 --> 00:09:04,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji!</font>

119
00:09:05,270 --> 00:09:08,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why, Neji? I can't stand this either.</font>

120
00:09:08,980 --> 00:09:12,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! From here on is an issue
for the Hidden Star.</font>

121
00:09:15,110 --> 00:09:16,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's none of our concern!</font>

122
00:09:17,660 --> 00:09:20,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That being said, are we just going
to leave them be?</font>

123
00:09:20,580 --> 00:09:22,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anything further would be beyond
the scope of the mission...</font>

124
00:09:22,660 --> 00:09:26,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Leaf must not betray the client
of the accepted mission, right?</font>

125
00:09:32,050 --> 00:09:33,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

126
00:09:39,970 --> 00:09:40,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, well.</font>

127
00:09:44,930 --> 00:09:48,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The star has returned.
I'll overlook everyone's actions today.</font>

128
00:09:49,560 --> 00:09:53,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those who wish to continue to live for
the sake of the village, come with me...</font>

129
00:09:53,690 --> 00:09:56,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... Sumaru is...</font>

130
00:09:59,450 --> 00:10:02,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Forsake the son of the traitor.</font>

131
00:10:02,870 --> 00:10:03,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pull out!</font>

132
00:10:03,950 --> 00:10:04,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, my lord!</font>

133
00:10:18,590 --> 00:10:21,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry. I must not leave
Sumaru behind.</font>

134
00:10:22,850 --> 00:10:24,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rogue Ninja!</font>

135
00:10:26,230 --> 00:10:27,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokuto! You'll regret this!</font>

136
00:10:28,390 --> 00:10:29,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, do as you like!</font>

137
00:10:31,360 --> 00:10:32,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That jerk...!</font>

138
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:17,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, look...!</font>

139
00:11:17,980 --> 00:11:20,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's called Natsuboshi.</font>

140
00:11:20,700 --> 00:11:23,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the other name for
the planet Mars, right?</font>

141
00:11:23,180 --> 00:11:26,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems it's the same name
as Sumaru's mom...</font>

142
00:11:26,600 --> 00:11:30,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru thinks that star
is protecting him.</font>

143
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:34,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I bet Lady Natsuhi was also
looking at that star.</font>

144
00:11:35,350 --> 00:11:37,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm moved.</font>

145
00:11:37,090 --> 00:11:39,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The hearts of parent and child
are connected!</font>

146
00:11:39,500 --> 00:11:40,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

147
00:11:46,750 --> 00:11:48,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How're the two doing?</font>

148
00:11:48,800 --> 00:11:50,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're resting comfortably now...</font>

149
00:11:50,940 --> 00:11:53,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But the Akahoshi attack
the mother took</font>

150
00:11:53,560 --> 00:11:58,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when her body was weakened from
the effects of the star is a fatal one.</font>

151
00:11:58,700 --> 00:12:01,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Her Chakra Network is in shreds
and it will mean certain death</font>

152
00:12:01,780 --> 00:12:04,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if she uses that Jutsu
even one more time...</font>

153
00:12:04,300 --> 00:12:08,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say what?! But Grandma Tsunade could...</font>

154
00:12:09,040 --> 00:12:10,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who knows...?</font>

155
00:12:12,360 --> 00:12:16,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it! That Akahoshi jerk
is unforgivable!</font>

156
00:12:16,300 --> 00:12:17,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll kick his butt!</font>

157
00:12:17,800 --> 00:12:19,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...! You still don't get it?</font>

158
00:12:23,840 --> 00:12:25,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But he's a huge scoundrel.</font>

159
00:12:25,380 --> 00:12:26,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right!</font>

160
00:12:27,200 --> 00:12:30,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Leaf would lose credibility</font>

161
00:12:30,560 --> 00:12:32,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if we did something like betray a client.</font>

162
00:12:32,520 --> 00:12:34,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But we can't leave things be, right?</font>

163
00:12:35,520 --> 00:12:37,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I also understand what
Neji's saying.</font>

164
00:12:37,980 --> 00:12:40,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We must ask the Hokage-sama
for instructions.</font>

165
00:12:41,030 --> 00:12:41,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right.</font>

166
00:12:42,030 --> 00:12:45,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyway, let's take those two
to the Village Hidden in the Leaves.</font>

167
00:12:46,200 --> 00:12:49,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... The Hidden Star matter
will come after that.</font>

168
00:13:03,260 --> 00:13:04,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru.</font>

169
00:13:04,970 --> 00:13:06,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mother!</font>

170
00:13:08,890 --> 00:13:09,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mother.</font>

171
00:13:35,660 --> 00:13:37,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're probably angry,
aren't you, Sumaru...?</font>

172
00:13:39,080 --> 00:13:42,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course, you would resent me...
who abandoned the village</font>

173
00:13:42,550 --> 00:13:45,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and went so far as to entrust you
to someone else.</font>

174
00:13:46,380 --> 00:13:49,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How often I attempted to take you
with me...</font>

175
00:13:50,510 --> 00:13:52,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I kept telling myself that</font>

176
00:13:52,720 --> 00:13:57,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I couldn't make you happy since
I had become a Rogue Ninja...</font>

177
00:13:57,810 --> 00:14:01,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with this body that could
give out at any time</font>

178
00:14:01,070 --> 00:14:04,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">due to the star training.</font>

179
00:14:09,990 --> 00:14:10,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stay away!</font>

180
00:14:13,580 --> 00:14:15,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I often had the same dream.</font>

181
00:14:18,670 --> 00:14:22,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A dream where I chase
after you two, crying.</font>

182
00:14:35,470 --> 00:14:36,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru.</font>

183
00:14:37,730 --> 00:14:40,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mother!</font>

184
00:14:42,360 --> 00:14:44,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I kept telling myself</font>

185
00:14:44,940 --> 00:14:46,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that my mother was not
a cold-hearted person</font>

186
00:14:46,690 --> 00:14:47,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who would leave me behind...</font>

187
00:14:48,650 --> 00:14:49,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You had died.</font>

188
00:14:50,410 --> 00:14:53,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like that man, the Third Hoshikage said.</font>

189
00:14:54,450 --> 00:14:56,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He said you had been killed by
a Ninja from some other land,</font>

190
00:14:57,410 --> 00:14:59,250
