191
00:15:04,210 --> 00:15:06,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He said you had turned
into the Natsuhiboshi...!</font>

192
00:15:39,040 --> 00:15:39,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru...</font>

193
00:15:42,920 --> 00:15:43,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mother!</font>

194
00:15:48,880 --> 00:15:50,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even so...</font>

195
00:15:51,590 --> 00:15:54,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even so... I wanted you
to take me with you.</font>

196
00:15:56,010 --> 00:15:56,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru...</font>

197
00:15:58,560 --> 00:16:00,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was lonesome... Mother...</font>

198
00:16:16,530 --> 00:16:22,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Natsuboshi, why are you so red?</font>

199
00:16:22,460 --> 00:16:27,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because I had a sad dream last night</font>

200
00:16:28,250 --> 00:16:33,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My eyes are red, from the tears I shed</font>

201
00:16:34,180 --> 00:16:39,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Swollen as I cried</font>

202
00:16:51,740 --> 00:16:57,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Natsuhiboshi, why've you lost your way?</font>

203
00:16:57,740 --> 00:17:02,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm searching for a child
Who has gone afar</font>

