207
00:17:47,170 --> 00:17:49,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where's the lady? Your mom.</font>

208
00:17:50,420 --> 00:17:52,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, where'd she go?</font>

209
00:17:52,670 --> 00:17:53,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

210
