<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is bad...</font>

211
00:17:57,760 --> 00:17:58,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mother!</font>

212
00:18:16,490 --> 00:18:19,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if it costs my life,
I can't let that star be...</font>

213
00:18:19,660 --> 00:18:23,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There mustn't be any more
